            "detailed_description": "The island Faranga needs a new hero, you!<br>\t\t\t\t\t<br>Delve into a gritty, raw and atmospheric fantasy world in which every action has a consequence. In the epic world of Risen, filled with mysterious earthquakes, fearsome monsters and unimaginable treasures, forge your path with the sword, learn the art of staff fighting or become a powerful mage.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Countless side quests and creatures to discover.<br></li><li>Over 60 hours of Immersive open world gameplay.<br></li><li>Alter the destiny of the island by the actions you take.</li></ul>",
