                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I like to think that my love for this game is not just nostalgia, but I have to be honest, as there is certainly a degree of such feelings. Nevertheless, I've played it many times, pirated it at first of course, I was a kid. Now as an adult I still want and wanted to return to it, it is special. The gameplay, the logic of the world, the quests. Everything is just done with heart, and yeah it's another Ghotic 2 Remake, but I love it anyway, doesn't make it any worse, just better. \r\n",
